39932913","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-99f538b156844a54beecf6fd05fc7421:10","title":"电商人一定要搞懂的ROI公式。#电商运营 #电商干货 #投产比 #新手开网店","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686470941413358245","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686470941413358245","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-99f538b156844a54beecf6fd05fc7421:11","title":"短视频带货全域推商品现在都是净成交ROI出价了，那么保本净成交ROI到底怎么算？这边和大家细细讲下！#短视频带货 #巨量千川全域推广 #商品卡  #干货分享 #保本ROI","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7592957882262490394","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7592957882262490394","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-99f538b156844a54beecf6fd05fc7421:12","title":"抖音电商-学习中心","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJd3G1D3QD3n","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/article/aJd3G1D3QD3n","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","question_text":"达人投放ROI怎么算？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":2,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":18,"valid_url_cards":18,"unique_url_events":17,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"1280cc781c9d152e5d7204d8a2ac392251e71bb4a46be6d703195c066049dcad","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 达人投放 2个常用公式（重点区分 ROI 和 ROAS，很多人会搞混）\n> **ROAS（业内常口头叫投产比，达人投放最常用）**\n**ROAS = 达人带来归因GMV ÷ 达人投放总成本**\n> 含义：每花1块投放费，带来多少销售额（看带货转化效率）\n\n> **ROI（标准投资回报率，财务真实盈亏，百分比）**\n**ROI(%) =（达人带来净利润 ÷ 达人投放总成本）×100%**\n> 含义：投入的钱，净回报率多少，判断到底赚不赚钱\n\n## 👉 达人投放总成本要包含全部投入（不要漏项）\n- 坑位费/达人固定服务费\n- 佣金（按成交计提）\n- 样品成本+样品运费\n- 给达人视频加热/投流费用\n- MCN服务费、平台手续费等分摊成本\n\n## 👉 归因GMV怎么取\n用**专属优惠码/专属链接/UTM**追踪达人订单，记得扣掉**退款**，取**实际支付GMV**。\n\n## 📌 举例子\n达人坑位费2000元，样品成本300元，总成本=2300元\n达人专属码成交GMV 9200元（已扣退货）\n- ROAS = 9200 ÷ 2300 = **4.0**（每花1元，卖4元货）\n\n假设商品毛利率40%\n毛利=9200 × 40% = 3680\n净利润 = 3680 − 2300 =1380\n- ROI = (1380 ÷ 2300) ×100% = **60%**\n\n> ⚠️重点提醒：**ROAS高≠赚钱**，还要看毛利率！\n> 比如ROAS=5，但产品毛利很低，扣掉货本+达人费，最后依然亏损\n\n## 📍保本ROAS（非常实用）\n**保本ROAS = 1 ÷ 毛利率**\n例：毛利率40%，保本ROAS=1÷0.4=2.5\n👉 ROAS＞2.5才有可能盈利，低于就亏钱\n\n## 补充：种草类达人（不带货，只做曝光）\n没法直接算成交ROI，就看种草价值：曝光成本、进店成本、加购成本、品牌搜索增量，评估种草价值。\n\n要不要我给你一个达人投放ROI计算表格模板，直接填坑位费、样品、GMV、毛利率自动算出ROAS和ROI？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-2b4ffc8f811d4569ad24a2c582b70950:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI: The Guide to Calculating Return on Investment","raw_url":"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/505330/Influencer-Marketing-ROI-eBook-Mediakix-2019.pdf?_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_qk_1hhX5PaVRU5UdECjwHHbr11cTLooXvVMYrcRishy_ZkxdN_mM6pC7X-5-6jzaQNyjVBEBEJ0pnVGa6VV3kMoARdA&_hsmi=73178211","normalized_url":"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/505330/Influencer-Marketing-ROI-eBook-Mediakix-2019.pdf?_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_qk_1hhX5PaVRU5UdECjwHHbr11cTLooXvVMYrcRishy_ZkxdN_mM6pC7X-5-6jzaQNyjVBEBEJ0pnVGa6VV3kMoARdA&_hsmi=73178211","host":"cdn2.hubspot.net","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-2b4ffc8f811d4569ad24a2c582b70950:2","title":"如何测算达人投放的ROI？ #达人营销 #增长 #增长黑客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdo