-roi-a-complete-guide-for-2026/","normalized_url":"https://influenceflow.io/resources/how-to-calculate-influencer-roi-a-complete-guide-for-2026/","host":"influenceflow.io","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-2b4ffc8f811d4569ad24a2c582b70950:16","title":"中小商家千川广告投放运营基础及工具使用","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_message","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8APt?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=buyin_message","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-2b4ffc8f811d4569ad24a2c582b70950:17","title":"How to Calculate Influencer Marketing ROI: Complete 2026 Framework","raw_url":"https://nowadays.media/blog/how-to-calculate-influencer-marketing-roi/","normalized_url":"https://nowadays.media/blog/how-to-calculate-influencer-marketing-roi/","host":"nowadays.media","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-2b4ffc8f811d4569ad24a2c582b70950:18","title":"TikTok Shop: ROI vs ROAS Explained","raw_url":"https://gotrellis.com/resources/blog/tiktok-shop-roi-vs-roas","normalized_url":"https://gotrellis.com/resources/blog/tiktok-shop-roi-vs-roas","host":"gotrellis.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","question_text":"达人投放ROI怎么算？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-12","repeat_index":3,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":18,"valid_url_cards":18,"unique_url_events":15,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"263c3e0e4701df9dfb5fe83760c9d2469f4c17eb149e2e7286bdbb46be0694b9","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 达人投放两个口径（电商最常用）\n> 行业里很多人把 **GMV÷投放成本** 叫ROI（严格来说是ROAS，但是电商投放圈习惯叫ROI）\n> 财务标准ROI（投资回报率）是利润口径，带百分号\n\n## 1、电商投放常用：GMV投产（ROAS，大家口语叫ROI）\n**达人ROI（GMV口径）= 达人链路带来成交GMV ÷ 达人投放总成本**\n- 达人投放总成本 = 达人坑位费 + 样品成本+运费 + 团长服务费 + 给这条视频追加的投流费（千川/薯条）\n> ⚠️ 佣金：如果是纯佣金无坑位达人，佣金是随订单扣，一般不算在前置投放成本；如果是坑位+佣金模式，坑位费算投放成本，佣金是订单成本，区分开。\n\n**例子：**\n达人坑位费5000元，样品+运费合计500元；达人专属链接成交GMV 24000元\nROI = 24000 ÷ (5000+500) = **4.36**\n👉 意思：每花1元投放费用，带来4.36元销售额\n\n> 建议：GMV记得**扣退货**，用**净GMV（确认收货）**计算更真实\n\n## 2、财务真实ROI（投资回报率，%）\n**ROI(%) =（达人带来毛利总额 − 达人投放总成本）÷ 达人投放总成本 ×100%**\n> 毛利总额 = 净GMV × 毛利率\n> 这里看真实赚了多少钱，判断是否盈利\n\n沿用上面例子：毛利率40%\n毛利=24000 × 40% =9600\n投放总成本=5500\nROI% = (9600 −5500) ÷5500 ×100% = **74.5%**\n👉 投入5500，净赚4100元，回报率74.5%\n\n# 📌 保本ROI（很关键！）\n**保本GMV ROI = 1 ÷ 毛利率**\n例：毛利率40% → 保本ROI=1÷0.4=2.5\n> 也就是：达人GMV投产要做到≥2.5，才刚好打平；高于2.5才有利润\n\n# 📌 怎么追踪达人成交？\n必须做归因，否则数据不准：\n1. 达人专属优惠码\n2. 专属商品链接/UTM追踪码\n3. 平台达人专属定向链路（抖音精选联盟、小红书商品卡）\n4. 统一归因周期：一般14天/30天，提前定好，包含长尾种草成交\n\n# 📌 坑：很多人算错的点\n1. 只算坑位费，漏算样品、运费、团长费、视频加热投流，ROI虚高\n2. 只看下单GMV，不扣退货，数据虚好看\n3. 混淆GMV口径ROAS和财务ROI，以为ROI>1就赚钱（错！要看保本ROI）\n\n如果你需要，我可以给你一个可直接复制的达人投放ROI计算表格。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-0c4a6e2b45494579ae481b24c432ab2e:1","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI: The Guide to Calculating Return on Investment","raw_url":"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/505330/Influencer-Marketing-ROI-eBook-Mediakix-2019.pdf?_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_qk_1hhX5PaVRU5UdECjwHHbr11cTLooXvVMYrcRishy_ZkxdN_mM6pC7X-5-6jzaQNyjVBEBEJ0pnVGa6VV3kMoARdA&_hsmi=73178211","normalized_url":"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/505330/Influe