pe":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-0c4a6e2b45494579ae481b24c432ab2e:14","title":"【千川乘方】从全域升级到乘方，会有什么变化？ #巨量千川 #千川乘方 #抖音电商 #商家经营 #抖音电商学习中心","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7669804468552207626","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7669804468552207626","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-0c4a6e2b45494579ae481b24c432ab2e:15","title":"小红书抖音充值返点。搞懂什么是ROI🔥如何优化，如何不亏💰 本篇从下面六个方面进行分享⬇️ 1️⃣🍠投放ROI是什么？ 2️⃣ROI有什么用？ 3️⃣🍠的ROI公式？ 4️⃣ROI盈亏平衡点？ 5️⃣","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7611746139331700906","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7611746139331700906","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-0c4a6e2b45494579ae481b24c432ab2e:16","title":"达人投放 ROI 测算✨投放人必存表格。做品牌投放的姐妹！不要再盲目砸💰找达人合作啦 一张表教你算清楚，达人报价到底值不值得冲✅  ▫️核心 ROI 计算公式 ROI = 投放带来总收益 ÷ 投放总成","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7687934386507852922","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7687934386507852922","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-0c4a6e2b45494579ae481b24c432ab2e:17","title":"#带货达人 #短视频带货 #电商带货 #新手带货 #保本roi计算方法","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671185449758569701","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7671185449758569701","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261012-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-0c4a6e2b45494579ae481b24c432ab2e:18","title":"关于修订《精选联盟推广费/服务费结算规则》的公示通知","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHvtwJYkigm8","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/web/article/aHvtwJYkigm8","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","question_text":"达人投放ROI怎么算？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":1,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":10,"valid_url_cards":10,"unique_url_events":8,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"544c1fd9587216f5ab76a1847f4f17faa07a024172d8b16f4724f209370d6cd5","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 达人投放两个常用指标（很多人会混淆）\n> **ROAS（电商口常叫投产比）：销售额 / 投放成本**（行业达人带货最常用，直接看1块钱带来多少GMV）\n> **ROI（投资回报率）：(净利润 / 投放成本) ×100%**，看赚多少钱，是财务口径\n\n## 1）ROAS（达人投放日常看的投产）\n**ROAS = 达人带来的追踪销售额 ÷ 达人项目总投入**\n> 投入包含：达人坑位费 + 样品成本+运费 + 给这条视频的投流费 + 佣金、服务费等全部花费\n\n例子：坑位费3000，样品+投流合计1000，总投入4000；达人专属券/链接带来GMV12000\nROAS = 12000 ÷ 4000 = **3.0**\n👉 每花1元，带来3元销售额\n\n## 2）ROI（真实利润回报，财务口径）\n**ROI =（达人带来净利润 ÷ 总投入）×100%**\n净利润 = 追踪销售额 - 产品货本(COGS) - 达人坑位费 - 佣金 - 样品、投流、售后退款损耗等所有成本\n\n沿用上面例子：GMV12000，货本+退款+佣金合计6000，总投入4000\n净利润 =12000−6000−4000=2000\nROI = (2000 ÷4000)×100% = **50%**\n👉 投入4000，净赚2000，回报率50%\n\n## 📌 保本ROAS（很重要，用来判断达人能不能做）\n**保本ROAS = 1 ÷ 毛利率**（简单版，忽略坑位费固定成本）\n> 毛利率=(售价-货本)/售价\n例：产品毛利率50%，保本ROAS=2。ROAS≥2才不亏（只看货本）\n> 如果有大额坑位费，保本ROAS要更高，不能只用这个简易公式\n\n## ⚠️ 关键坑点（算不准的根源）\n1. **归因**：一定要用专属短链/专属优惠码/UTM，区分哪些订单来自这个达人；自然搜索、后续复购要不要计入，团队统一规则，前后口径一致\n2. **退款**：建议用**确认收货GMV**，不要用拍下GMV，不然会虚高ROAS\n3. **成本口径统一**：有的团队只算坑位费，有的加样品、投流、佣金；对比达人效果，**口径必须一样**\n4. **短期vs长期**：短期ROAS只看视频7/15天直接成交；长期ROI可加这次达人种草带来的后续复购（LTV），适合品牌种草达人评估\n\n## 快速一句话区分\n- 做达人投放复盘、达人筛选：优先看 **ROAS（GMV/投入）**\n- 判断这次达人合作到底赚不赚钱：看 **ROI（利润回报率）**\n\n要不要我给你一个可直接复制到Excel的达人ROI计算模板？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:1","title":"达人正确计算保本Roi方法，90%的人都是错误的！计算公式在最后，什么是保本roi，投入产出比。#巨量千川 #小店随心推#全域推广  #干货分享","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:2","title":"如何测算达人投放的ROI？ #达人营销 #增长 #增长黑客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:3","title":"达人 ROI 怎么算 做宠物达人投放，最难的就是算 ROI——投了 10 个达人，到底赚了还是亏了？9 成新人算不清，全靠感觉。其实达人 ROI 有标准计算方法，按公式算就清楚。这条视频讲 ROI 计","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7643642181802102062","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7643642181802102062","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:4","title":"How to Calculate Influencer Marketing ROI (With Calculator) - InfluenceKit","raw_url":"https://www.influencekit.com/pages/calculate-influencer-roi","normalized_url":"https://www.influencekit.com/pages/calculate-influencer-roi","host":"www.influencekit.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:5","title":"How to Calculate Influencer Marketing ROI — Formula, Benchmarks & Tracking | True Margin | True Margin","raw_url":"https://truemargin.ai/blog/how-to-calculate-influencer-marketing-roi","normalized_url":"https://truemargin.ai/blog/how-to-calculate-influencer-marketing-roi","host":"truemargin.ai","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:6","title":"ROI of Influencer Marketing: How to Calculate It (2025) - Shopify UK","raw_url":"https://www.shopify.com/uk/enterprise/blog/roi-influencer-marketing","normalized_url":"https://www.shopify.com/uk/enterprise/blog/roi-influencer-marketing","host":"www.shopify.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:7","title":"达人正确计算保本Roi方法，90%的人都是错误的！计算公式在最后，什么是保本roi，投入产出比。#巨量千川 #小店随心推#全域推广  #干货分享","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:8","title":"达人营销ROI怎么算?从成本口径到归因的公式拆解 - 花漾灵动 | TikTok Shop 运营干货","raw_url":"https://tk.szdamai.com/blog/operations/2026-09/creator-marketing-roi","normalized_url":"https://tk.szdamai.com/blog/operations/2026-09/creator-marketing-roi","host":"tk.szdamai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:9","title":"如何测算达人投放的ROI？ #达人营销 #增长 #增长黑客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R01-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-dad8adb3126143ff8648d60095f98bca:10","title":"电商人一定要搞懂的ROI公式。#电商运营 #电商干货 #投产比 #新手开网店","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686470941413358245","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7686470941413358245","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","question_text":"达人投放ROI怎么算？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":2,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":12,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"467eb28862fdbfc9e44fdfb395b20e96c7cfecb0e93e99e45c309e3f2fd27766","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 达人投放两个常用口径（电商最常用）\n> 很多人会混淆 **ROAS（GMV口径，投放圈常口头叫ROI）** 和 **真实ROI（利润口径，财务口径）**\n\n## 1、GMV口径（达人投放日常复盘用，行业最多）\n**ROAS（大家口语叫ROI）= 达人内容带来的归因GMV ÷ 达人投放总成本**\n> 总成本 = 坑位费 + 佣金 + 样品成本 + 给达人投流费用 + 服务费等\n\n👉例子：达人坑位费3000，样品成本500，佣金合计2000，总成本5500；视频专属码/链接追踪GMV 22000\nROAS = 22000 ÷ 5500 = **4.0**\n意思：每花1元，带来4元销售额。\n\n## 2、真实利润ROI（看赚不赚钱，财务口径）\n**ROI =（达人带来毛利总额 − 达人投放总成本）÷ 达人投放总成本 ×100%**\n毛利总额=归因销售额 × 毛利率（扣掉货本、平台扣点，记得扣退货）\n\n👉沿用上面例子，商品毛利率40%，GMV22000，毛利=22000×40%=8800\nROI=(8800−5500)÷5500×100% = **60%**\n意思：投入5500，净赚3300，投资回报率60%\n\n# 📌 保本ROI（非常重要，用来提前评估达人能不能做）\n**保本ROAS = 1 ÷ 毛利率**（简化版，未扣退货、平台费）\n例：毛利率40% → 保本ROAS=1÷0.4=**2.5**\n> 也就是你的达人ROAS必须＞2.5才不会亏钱。如果有退货、平台扣点，保本ROAS会更高。\n\n# ⚠️ 关键注意点\n1. **归因**：要用专属短链/专属优惠码/达人券追踪直接成交；种草还有间接“光环效应”，直接GMV会低估真实价值\n2. **成本别漏算**：坑位费、样品成本、快递费、MCN服务费、给达人视频追加投流的钱，全部计入投放成本\n3. **退货**：复盘一定要扣掉售后退款，很多达人看着ROAS好看，退货后直接亏损\n\n# 快速区分\n- **ROAS（GMV/花费）**：投放运营看，判断流量转化\n- **ROI（利润/花费）**：老板财务看，判断是否赚钱\n\n你要不要我给你一个可直接复制到Excel的达人ROI计算表模板（自动算保本ROAS、扣退货）？","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:1","title":"达人正确计算保本Roi方法，90%的人都是错误的！计算公式在最后，什么是保本roi，投入产出比。#巨量千川 #小店随心推#全域推广  #干货分享","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:2","title":"Influencer Marketing ROI: The Guide to Calculating Return on Investment","raw_url":"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/505330/Influencer-Marketing-ROI-eBook-Mediakix-2019.pdf?_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_qk_1hhX5PaVRU5UdECjwHHbr11cTLooXvVMYrcRishy_ZkxdN_mM6pC7X-5-6jzaQNyjVBEBEJ0pnVGa6VV3kMoARdA&_hsmi=73178211","normalized_url":"https://cdn2.hubspot.net/hubfs/505330/Influencer-Marketing-ROI-eBook-Mediakix-2019.pdf?_hsenc=p2ANqtz-_qk_1hhX5PaVRU5UdECjwHHbr11cTLooXvVMYrcRishy_ZkxdN_mM6pC7X-5-6jzaQNyjVBEBEJ0pnVGa6VV3kMoARdA&_hsmi=73178211","host":"cdn2.hubspot.net","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:3","title":"如何测算达人投放的ROI？ #达人营销 #增长 #增长黑客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","con