n"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:8","title":"抖音电商-学习中心","raw_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8fcn?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=href","normalized_url":"https://school.jinritemai.com/doudian/wap/course-series/cJZHjLnhaLyw/cJZHjLnhaLywlJZJUawr8fcn?should_hide_bottom_nav=1&from_school=1&should_full_screen=1&from=href","host":"school.jinritemai.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:9","title":"达人投放，如何稳住ROI？ #达人营销 #营销思维 #增长","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7668664380493674929","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7668664380493674929","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:10","title":"达人投放 ROI 测算✨投放人必存表格。做品牌投放的姐妹！不要再盲目砸💰找达人合作啦 一张表教你算清楚，达人报价到底值不值得冲✅  ▫️核心 ROI 计算公式 ROI = 投放带来总收益 ÷ 投放总成","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7687934386507852922","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7687934386507852922","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:11","title":"Influencer Marketing for E-Commerce Brands: Complete Creator Pricing and ROI Guide","raw_url":"https://www.influencerfee.com/blog/influencer-marketing-for-e-commerce-brands/","normalized_url":"https://www.influencerfee.com/blog/influencer-marketing-for-e-commerce-brands/","host":"www.influencerfee.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R02-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-67207cd760f44949aa0ed589c5c3a906:12","title":"达人ROI低怎么办-蝉妈妈AI抖音数据分析工具","raw_url":"https://ai.chanmama.com/article/858","normalized_url":"https://ai.chanmama.com/article/858","host":"ai.chanmama.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"}]},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","question_text":"达人投放ROI怎么算？","category":"业务场景型","pool":"核心池","sample_date":"2026-10-13","repeat_index":3,"citation_state":"pass","card_count":12,"valid_url_cards":12,"unique_url_events":10,"official_events":0,"strict_question_match":true,"answer_sha256":"d2fabcdb8f045532191d84f7d260c53fa7ede71cd187bc4af879de30003c5e9f","semantic_audit_status":"pending_full_evidence_audit","applicable":[],"recommendation_applicable":false,"advantage_items":[],"answer_text":"# ✅ 达人投放ROI（电商常用，分2种口径）\n> 行业里电商达人投放，很多人说的**ROI其实是ROAS（广告投产：销售额/花费）**；严格财务ROI是利润口径，不要搞混\n\n## 1、电商运营常用：ROAS（大家口头叫ROI）\n**ROAS = 达人带来的归因销售额 ÷ 达人投放总花费**\n- 达人投放总花费：坑位费 + 样品成本+寄样运费 + 给达人视频加热投流费 + MCN服务费\n- 归因销售额：专属优惠券/UTM/达人链接追踪到的成交（建议扣掉退款）\n\n👉例子：达人坑位费3000，样品成本500，达人视频投流1000；达人专属券带来**退款后销售额20000**\n总花费=3000+500+1000=4500\nROAS=20000 ÷ 4500 = **4.44**\n意思：每花1块，带来4.44元销售额\n\n## 2、财务真实ROI（利润口径，看赚不赚钱）\n**ROI(%) =（达人带来净利润 ÷ 达人投放总花费）×100%**\n净利润=归因销售额 - 产品成本 - 平台扣点 - 运费 - 达人坑位费佣金 - 其他相关成本\n\n👉沿用上面例子：20000销售额，货品+平台扣点+运费合计11000，达人总花费4500\n净利润=20000-11000-4500=4500\nROI=4500 ÷4500 ×100% = **100%**，也就是投入1万，赚回1万利润\n\n## 🔥 保本ROI（非常关键，判断盈亏线）\n**保本ROAS = 1 ÷ 产品毛利率**\n毛利率=（售价-货品成本-平台扣点-快递费）÷售价\n> 例：产品毛利率40%，保本ROAS=1÷0.4=2.5；也就是ROAS≥2.5才不亏钱，低于2.5看着有销售额，实际亏损\n\n## 📌 达人合作两种模式怎么归集成本\n1. **纯坑位费**：坑位费+样品+投流，全部计入投放花费\n2. **纯佣金合作**：没有坑位费，佣金属于变动成本，一般不计入投放固定花费，核算毛利时扣佣金即可；如果是坑位费+佣金，佣金也要计入成本\n\n## ⚠️ 容易踩坑的点\n1. **归因问题**：达人种草后，用户直接搜品牌下单，这部分自然溢出销量要不要算，提前定好规则\n2. **退款**：一定要用**退款后净销售额**，否则ROI虚高\n3. **样品成本**：很多人漏算，大量寄样不产出，成本会很高\n4. **短期vs长期**：短视频达人很多有长尾转化，可设置7天/14天/30天归因窗口\n\n如果你想要，我可以给你一个可直接复制的达人投放ROI核算表模板。","sources":[{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-fe346a1ae40d4c9ea8cdc676e97df225:1","title":"达人正确计算保本Roi方法，90%的人都是错误的！计算公式在最后，什么是保本roi，投入产出比。#巨量千川 #小店随心推#全域推广  #干货分享","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7549856454313545017","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-fe346a1ae40d4c9ea8cdc676e97df225:2","title":"如何测算达人投放的ROI？ #达人营销 #增长 #增长黑客","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7667503929039932913","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-fe346a1ae40d4c9ea8cdc676e97df225:3","title":"达人 ROI 怎么算 做宠物达人投放，最难的就是算 ROI——投了 10 个达人，到底赚了还是亏了？9 成新人算不清，全靠感觉。其实达人 ROI 有标准计算方法，按公式算就清楚。这条视频讲 ROI 计","raw_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7643642181802102062","normalized_url":"https://www.iesdouyin.com/share/video/7643642181802102062","host":"www.iesdouyin.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","accessibility":"unknown"},{"sample_id":"CQQ-R2-20261013-CORE-R03-CQ-Q0079","question_id":"CQ-Q0079","citation_id":"smp-fe346a1ae40d4c9ea8cdc676e97df225:4","title":"How to Calculate Influencer Marketing ROI (With Calculator) - InfluenceKit","raw_url":"https://www.influencekit.com/pages/calculate-influencer-roi","normalized_url":"https://www.influencekit.com/pages/calculate-influencer-roi","host":"www.influencekit.com","source_type":"third_party","content_support_status":"unknown","